f a felony. <BR>(Code 1923, §4941; Code 1940, T. 14, §357; Code 1975, §13-1-6.) <BR><P>------------------<BR>Adam J. B.<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero_3.jpg">   <BR>you gotta keep on keepin on...<BR>IM AOL: GTFiero &  Rumpdetective (dont ask)||||reg||1
